titel = "Iron Tithe"
img = ExtResource("2")
description = "The elder raps the wagon once. “Trading Post smiths. They know the mark. Don’t stop for every pretty tack-stall on the way.”

Your mares lean into the traces. The iron sings softly whenever a wheel hits a stone."
